    "description": {
      "value": "This supple, light wooden wand drifts to the ground like a feather or leaf when dropped, landing unharmed. A thin coil of metal wraps around the wand's handle. You cast jump, but can jump up to 60 feet. When you land you shatter the ground, making each creature in a 5-foot emanation flat-footed until the start of its next turn. In addition, the space you land in and all squares in the emanation become difficult terrain for 1 minute."
